  "notes": "Behavior-contract inventory derived 2026-07-29 from the blink-dev PSA (1-_VfY1NIQs), the ChromeStatus record 5863296436666368 (milestone=152 listing category 'Enabled by default'), and Chromium source (about_flags.cc, app_shim_controller.mm, app_shim_manager_mac.h, web_app_tab_helper.cc, permission_prompt_notifications_mac.cc). The feature adds no web API surface — the PSA calls the changes 'not directly web-exposed' — so the inventory is the four behavior contracts: attribution delivery + requirements + two-layer permission (overview), requireInteraction (child route), badging gate (child route), enterprise pre-grant (child route). Known honest gaps: no public document yet details the MDM payload keys for PWA shim bundle IDs (open question in _questions.json); the tracking bug 327449602 requires Google sign-in for full content, so implementation claims were verified against the public source files instead."
